    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Invite a friend along to join for free using the friend pass! Only <u>ONE</u>\u00a0player needs to own the game to unlock the full experience! </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>(If both players are using the friend pass, you'll only have access to the demo portion of the game.)</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two the Top is a cooperative precision platformer where the only obstacle is falling. Bring a friend along and work together as you climb your way to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple-to-learn controls that reward mastery. (Left, Right, Jump, Wall Jump, Yoyo)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise, Co-op platforming that will put your teamwork and patience to the test!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through 6 different environments with their own unique challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your step, a fall could lose you a lot of progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/606ab70bd9dd7ccfc8483a3266ca5a05.avif?t=1750438876\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/7e17b8db9d7441701549501e6d37ecee.poster.avif?t=1750438876\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/7e17b8db9d7441701549501e6d37ecee.webm?t=1750438876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/7e17b8db9d7441701549501e6d37ecee.mp4?t=1750438876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey for two;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be relying on your climbing partner to climb this mountain together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce off your partner's head to boost high up into the air, and let down your yoyo to let them climb up after you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/fa68198fcfbba690570c77b881c2a810.webp?t=1750438876\" width=594 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/57ec2dfed709ccd92d9a027ee7bfb671.poster.avif?t=1750438876\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/57ec2dfed709ccd92d9a027ee7bfb671.webm?t=1750438876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/57ec2dfed709ccd92d9a027ee7bfb671.mp4?t=1750438876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nail-Biting, High-Stakes Level Design</strong>\u00a0where every jump is meaningful and holds weight; each fall is an opportunity to learn and improve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be patient, be kind and you'll make it to the top!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>So...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you both make it to the top?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Invite a friend along to join for free using the friend pass! Only <u>ONE</u>\u00a0player needs to own the game to unlock the full experience! </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>(If both players are using the friend pass, you'll only have access to the demo portion of the game.)</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two the Top is a cooperative precision platformer where the only obstacle is falling. Bring a friend along and work together as you climb your way to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple-to-learn controls that reward mastery. (Left, Right, Jump, Wall Jump, Yoyo)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise, Co-op platforming that will put your teamwork and patience to the test!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through 6 different environments with their own unique challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your step, a fall could lose you a lot of progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/606ab70bd9dd7ccfc8483a3266ca5a05.avif?t=1750438876\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/7e17b8db9d7441701549501e6d37ecee.poster.avif?t=1750438876\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/7e17b8db9d7441701549501e6d37ecee.webm?t=1750438876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/7e17b8db9d7441701549501e6d37ecee.mp4?t=1750438876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey for two;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be relying on your climbing partner to climb this mountain together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce off your partner's head to boost high up into the air, and let down your yoyo to let them climb up after you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/fa68198fcfbba690570c77b881c2a810.webp?t=1750438876\" width=594 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/57ec2dfed709ccd92d9a027ee7bfb671.poster.avif?t=1750438876\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/57ec2dfed709ccd92d9a027ee7bfb671.webm?t=1750438876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/57ec2dfed709ccd92d9a027ee7bfb671.mp4?t=1750438876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nail-Biting, High-Stakes Level Design</strong>\u00a0where every jump is meaningful and holds weight; each fall is an opportunity to learn and improve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be patient, be kind and you'll make it to the top!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>So...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you both make it to the top?</p>",
